</div><div id="inner_content-2-11" class="ct-inner-content"><section id="section-2-48" class=" ct-section c-hero-xs"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h2 id="headline-3-48" class="ct-headline c-h1 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">About QT' Kitchen Glen iris</h2><a id="link-4-48" class="ct-link c-transition c-btn-s" href="/lunch-dinner-menu-2024"><div id="text_block-5-48" class="ct-text-block c-margin-right-m">View Our Menu</div><div id="fancy_icon-6-48" class="ct-fancy-icon c-icon-dark-s"><svg id="svg-fancy_icon-6-48"><use xlink:href="#Lineariconsicon-arrow-right"></use></svg></div></a></div></section><section id="section-8-48" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h2 id="headline-9-48" class="ct-headline c-h2 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">Rich Vietnamese Flavours &amp; beautiful fresh Australian produce in the heart of Glen iris. Fully Licensed Only, No BYO.</h2><div id="text_block-10-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-l c-margin-bottom-l c-text-light">Founded in 2017 by Kevin Pham (Head Chef) &amp; Kenny Truong (Front of House), QT' Kitchen has quickly become an institution in Glen Iris, Ashburton, Camberwell and surrounding suburbs of Melbourne.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>The team hopes to please every customer with superb front of house service, a creative, delicious menu and a bustling ambience that is warm &amp;&nbsp; welcoming.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://staging.qtkitchen.com/functions">Functions</a>&nbsp;are held regularly in the 90 seat space where family and friends come together to celebrate birthdays, anniversaries, school friendships and much more.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>Bookings are recommended although apart from our busiest times on Friday &amp; Saturday night you can generally find a table in our spacious venue.<br><br>We can't wait to serve you.<br><br><b>QT' Kitchen Team</b></div><div id="text_block-12-48" class="ct-text-block c-margin-bottom-m c-text-l c-heading-dark"></div><img id="image-14-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/BMW01093-copy.jpg" class="ct-image c-img-max"></div></section><section id="section-15-48" class=" ct-section c-bg-light c-bg-dark-alt"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="div_block-16-48" class="ct-div-block c-columns-5 c-columns-l-4 c-columns-m-2 c-card-light c-gallery"><div id="div_block-17-48" class="ct-div-block c-padding-m"><h2 id="headline-18-48" class="ct-headline c-h3 c-heading-dark">Instagram</h2></div><img id="image-19-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/BMW00274.jpg" class="ct-image c-row-span-2"><img id="image-20-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/BMW00386.jpg" class="ct-image "><img id="image-21-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/BMW00288.jpg" class="ct-image c-row-span-2"><img id="image-22-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/BMW00516.jpg" class="ct-image "><img id="image-23-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/138329562_963352027741432_1464460403415924844_n.jpg" class="ct-image "><img id="image-24-48" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/BMW02658.jpg" class="ct-image "><a id="link-25-48" class="ct-link c-bg-accent c-transition" href="https://www.instagram.com/qtkitchenmelb/" target="_blank"><div id="fancy_icon-26-48" class="ct-fancy-icon "><svg id="svg-fancy_icon-26-48"><use xlink:href="#Lineariconsicon-arrow-right"></use></svg></div></a></div></div></section><section id="section-43-48" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h1 id="headline-44-48" class="ct-headline c-h2 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">Meet The Team</h1><div id="text_block-45-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-m c-margin-bottom-l c-text-light">Led by dynamic duo Kevin Pham &amp; Kenny Truong, the team have a combined 30 years of experience in hospitality.<br></div><div id="div_block-46-48" class="ct-div-block c-columns-l-2 c-columns-m-1 c-columns-gap-l c-margin-bottom-l c-columns-2"><div id="div_block-47-48" class="ct-div-block c-left c-margin-right-m"><div id="div_block-48-48" class="ct-div-block c-avatar-full c-shadow c-margin-right-m"></div><div id="text_block-52-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-xl c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-dark c-text-light">The secret ingredient in a recipe is always love. Great cooking experience comes from the heart and soul. A recipe has no soul, so you must bring soul to it as a chef.</div><div id="text_block-53-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-m c-margin-bottom-xs c-text-light">Kevin Pham</div><div id="text_block-54-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-s c-text-dark c-text-light">Head Chef<br></div><div id="text_block-55-48" class="ct-text-block c-heading-dark c-text-s c-text-light"><b>QT' Kitchen</b><br></div></div><div id="div_block-56-48" class="ct-div-block c-left c-margin-right-m"><div id="div_block-57-48" class="ct-div-block c-avatar-full c-shadow"></div><div id="text_block-61-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-xl c-margin-bottom-m c-text-light">Hospitality is simply an opportunity to show love and care. I would love to be someone who makes everybody feel special when they step foot in our dining room.</div><div id="text_block-62-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-m c-margin-bottom-xs c-text-dark c-text-light">Kenny Truong</div><div id="text_block-63-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-s c-text-dark c-text-light">FOH Manager<br></div><div id="text_block-64-48" class="ct-text-block c-heading-dark c-text-s c-text-light">QT' Kitchen<br></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-27-48" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark-alt"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="div_block-28-48" class="ct-div-block c-columns-3 c-columns-m-1 c-columns-gap-l"><div id="div_block-29-48" class="ct-div-block c-left c-margin-right-m"><h3 id="headline-30-48" class="ct-headline c-h3 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">Explore Our Menus</h3><div id="text_block-31-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-m c-margin-bottom-m c-text-light">Hungry yet?&nbsp; Take a peek at what you can expect for brunch and dinner at a Glen Iris institution.</div><a id="link_text-32-48" class="ct-link-text c-btn-main c-transition c-btn-m" href="http://qtkitchen.com.au/book">BOOK NOW</a></div><div id="div_block-33-48" class="ct-div-block c-card-dark c-left c-padding-xl c-margin-right-m"><h4 id="headline-34-48" class="ct-headline c-h4 c-margin-bottom-s c-heading-light">Lunch Menu</h4><div id="text_block-35-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-l c-margin-bottom-m c-text-light">Flavours of the east paired with fresh Australian produce for breakfast &amp; lunch.</div><a id="link-36-48" class="ct-link c-btn-transparent c-transition c-btn-m" href="/lunch-menu"><div id="text_block-37-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-light">View Menu</div></a></div><div id="div_block-38-48" class="ct-div-block c-card-accent c-padding-xl"><h4 id="headline-39-48" class="ct-headline c-h4 c-margin-bottom-s c-heading-dark">Dinner Menu</h4><div id="text_block-40-48" class="ct-text-block c-text-l c-margin-bottom-m c-text-dark">All dishes are full of flavour and perfectly finished by our experienced kitchen team.</div><a id="link-41-48" class="ct-link c-transition c-btn-main" href="/dinner-menu"><div id="text_block-42-48" class="ct-text-block c-btn-m c-btn-alt">View Menu</div></a></div></div></div></section></div><footer id="section-242-12" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="div_block-243-12" class="ct-div-block c-columns-6 c-columns-l-2 c-columns-gap-l c-margin-bottom-l"><div id="div_block-244-12" class="ct-div-block c-col-span-2 c-margin-right-m"><img id="image-245-12" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/logo_transparent_background.png" class="ct-image c-logo c-margin-bottom-m"><div id="text_block-246-12" class="ct-text-block c-text-s c-text-light">Incredible Vietnamese Fusion Cuisine in Glen Iris.&nbsp; Open from Lunch until late.&nbsp; Renown for bold flavours and hearty service from hospitality veterans.</div></div><div id="div_block-254-12" class="ct-div-block "><div id="text_block-255-12" class="ct-text-block c-margin-bottom-s c-heading-light">Who Are We</div><a id="link_text-256-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/about-us">About Us</a><a id="link_text-257-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/functions-in-glen-iris">Functions</a><a id="link_text-258-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a><a id="link_text-259-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/lunch-menu">Brunch &amp; Lunch in Glen iris</a><a id="link_text-260-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/dinner-menu">Vietnamese in Glen Iris</a></div><div id="div_block-261-12" class="ct-div-block "><div id="text_block-262-12" class="ct-text-block c-margin-bottom-s c-heading-light">Menus</div><a id="link_text-263-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/lunch-menu">Lunch Menu</a><a id="link_text-264-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/dinner-menu">Dinner Menu</a><a id="link_text-265-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="https://qtkitchen.square.site/" target="_blank">Order Takeaway Glen Iris</a></div><div id="div_block-323-12" class="ct-div-block "><a id="link_text-329-12" class="ct-link-text c-btn-main c-transition c-btn-m" href="/book-now">book now</a></div></div><div id="div_block-276-12" class="ct-div-block c-footer-row"><div id="text_block-277-12" class="ct-text-block c-text-s c-text-dark">Copyright © 2022 QT' Kitchen</div><div id="div_block-278-12" class="ct-div-block c-inline"><a id="link-279-12" class="ct-link" href="https://www.facebook.com/qtkitchengleniris" target="_blank"><div id="fancy_icon-280-12" class="ct-fancy-icon c-transition c-margin-right-m"><svg id="svg-fancy_icon-280-12"><use xlink:href="#FontAwesomeicon-facebook-square"></use></svg></div></a><a id="link-281-12" class="ct-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/qtkitchenmelb/" target="_blank"><div id="fancy_icon-282-12" class="ct-fancy-icon c-transition"><svg id="svg-fancy_icon-282-12"><use xlink:href="#FontAwesomeicon-instagram"></use></svg></div></a></div></div></div></footer>

